#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:2
msgid "Bluecat"
msgstr "Bluecat"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:7
msgid ""
"|morpheus| integrates with Bluecat IPAM to scope pools to networks for "
"static IP assignment from Bluecat to your |morpheus| Instances."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| integrates con Bluecat IPAM to scope pools to networks para "
"static IP assignment desde Bluecat to your |morpheus| Instances."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:10
msgid "Adding Bluecat to |morpheus|"
msgstr "Agregar Bluecat to |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:12
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations``"
msgstr "Navegue un ``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations``"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:13
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:14
msgid "Select `Bluecat`"
msgstr "Select `Bluecat`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:15
msgid "Enter in the following information"
msgstr "Enter in la siguiente información"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:17
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Name"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:18
msgid "Name of the Bluecat Integration in |morpheus|"
msgstr "Name of el Bluecat Integration in |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:19
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Enabled"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:20
msgid "Uncheck to disable sync with the Bluecat endpoint"
msgstr "Uncheck to disable sync con el Bluecat endpoint"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:21
msgid "URL"
msgstr "URL"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:22
msgid "URL of the Bluecat server, ex: ``http://10.30.20.10``"
msgstr "URL of el Bluecat server, ex: ``http://10.30.20.10``"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:23
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Username"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:24
msgid ""
"Username of Bluecat API User. API and root level propagating read access "
"required, read/write access required for target Networks and Domains."
msgstr ""
"Username of Bluecat API User. API y root level propagating read acceso "
"requerido, read/write acceso requerido para destino Networks y Domains."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:25
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Password"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:26
msgid "Bluecat User password"
msgstr "Bluecat User contraseña"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:28
msgid "Network Filter"
msgstr "Network Filter"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:28
msgid ""
"Optionally enter a comma-separated list of ``entityIds`` for config(s), "
"block(s) or network(s) (ex. ``entityId1,entityId2...``) to filter the synced"
" IP pools, networks and domains"
msgstr ""
"Opcionalmente enter un comma-separated lista of ``entityIds`` para "
"config(s), block(s) o network(s) (ex. ``entityId1,entityId2...``) to filter "
"el synced IP pools, networks y domains"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:30
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`GUARDAR CHANGES`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:32
msgid ""
"The Bluecat Integration will be saved, IP pools will sync in and populate "
"under ``Infrastructure > Network > IP Pools``, and Domains will populate in "
"``Infrastructure > Network > Domains``. Pools and Domains can also be found "
"in the Bluecat Integration details page, which can be accessed by clicking "
"on the name of the added Bluecat Integration in ``Infrastructure > Network >"
" Services``."
msgstr ""
"The Bluecat Integration será be saved, IP pools será sync in y populate "
"under ``Infrastructure > Network > IP Pools``, y Domains será populate in "
"``Infrastructure > Network > Domains``. Pools y Domains puede también be "
"found in el Bluecat Integration detalles página, cual se puede acceder by "
"clicking on el nombre of el agregado Bluecat Integration in ``Infrastructure"
" > Network > Services``."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:34
msgid ""
"`Quick Deployments` must be enabled in Bluecat for |morpheus| to create "
"instantly available DNS records when using Bluecat DNS."
msgstr ""
"`Quick Deployments` debe estar habilitado in Bluecat para |morpheus| to "
"create instantly disponible DNS registros cuando using Bluecat DNS."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:37
msgid "Adding IP Pools to Networks"
msgstr "Agregar IP Pools to Networks"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:39
msgid ""
"|morpheus| can automatically assign the next available Bluecat IP in an "
"IP/Network Pool and create the corresponding DNS records, as well as remove "
"the records upon teardown. To enable this, add an Bluecat IP/Network Pool to"
" the `Network Pool` section on a Network(s)."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| puede automáticamente assign el siguiente disponible Bluecat IP "
"in un IP/Network Pool y create el corresponding DNS registros, así como "
"remove el registros sobre teardown. To enable este, add un Bluecat "
"IP/Network Pool to el `Network Pool` sección on un Network(s)."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:41
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure - Network- Networks``"
msgstr "Navegue un ``Infrastructure - Network- Networks``"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:42
msgid "Select a Network name and EDIT, or select `ACTIONS - Edit`"
msgstr "Select un Network nombre y EDIT, o select `ACTIONS - Edit`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:43
msgid ""
"In the `NETWORK POOL` section, search for and select the name of the "
"IP/Network Pool."
msgstr ""
"En el `NETWORK POOL` sección, search para y select el nombre of el "
"IP/Network Pool."

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:45
msgid "Gateway, DNS and CIDR must be populated for static/pool IP assignment"
msgstr "Gateway, DNS y CIDR debe be populated para static/pool IP assignment"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:46
msgid ""
"Select `Allow IP Override` to allow selecting between DHCP, Static entry and"
" Pool Selection at provision time"
msgstr ""
"Select `Allow IP Override` to allow selecting entre DHCP, Static entry y "
"Pool Selection at provision time"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:47
msgid ""
"Deselect DHCP server if a DHCP server will not be used on the network (only "
"static and/or IP Pool IP assignment)"
msgstr ""
"Deselect DHCP server if un DHCP server no be used on la red (solo static y/o"
" IP Pool IP assignment)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/bluecat.rst:49
msgid "Select :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Select :guilabel:`GUARDAR CHANGES`"
